<title>USA: Novavax names new CFO.</title>
<headline>Novavax names new CFO.</headline>
<dateline>COLUMBIA, Md. 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Novavax Inc said Thursday that it has named Brenda Fugagli chief financial officer of the bio-pharmaceutical drug delivery company.</p>
<p>Most recently, Fugagli was president and chief operating officer of a FoxMeyer Health Corp subsidiary. Before that, she was senior vice president of marketing at FoxMeyer.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
